# Test-only value for the demo-janazah emulator project.
#
# Safe to commit: Firebase reserves the "demo-" project id prefix exclusively
# for local emulation, so this file can never be picked up for a real deploy
# target. It exists so the functions emulator can start non-interactively
# (npm test, npm run demo); without it, SITE_ORIGIN has no default by design
# (see functions/index.js) and the CLI hangs prompting for one, which breaks
# any non-interactive run including CI.
#
# A real deployment still requires its own functions/.env with a real origin,
# per docs/deployment.md. That file stays gitignored.
SITE_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5000
